# Chocobilious (windurst 27) at GIL_RATE 1.0625: Kuoh Rhel's 231 reward gil is GIL_RATE x 1500 (1593.75 -> 1594 by the
# engine's integral getter; a missing rate would give 1500). Accepted at var 2 (GM): his default 222, then script 231.
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=129.5,-5.0,-104.0 job=WAR lvl=75
setting GIL_RATE 1.0625
login
quest Windurst.Chocobilious accepted
charvar ChocobiliousQuest 2
trigger Kuoh_Rhel                       # his default 222
finish
